ll, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "它是一台長了輪子的巨型蹺蹺板", "start": 3.986, "end": 7.366, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "前輪就是支點，前面的貨物有多重", "start": 7.366, "end": 10.566, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "車尾沉重的鑄鐵配重就必須頂住多大的力矩", "start": 10.566, "end": 15.066, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "一般的汽車靠四點支撐", "start": 15.066, "end": 17.032, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "但堆高機的後輪轉向軸只有一個中心支點", "start": 17.032, "end": 20.428, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "在地面構成一個脆弱的穩定性三角形", "start": 20.428, "end": 23.966, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "只要貨叉升得太高、急轉彎或者路面傾斜", "start": 23.966, "end": 27.549, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "整個系統的重心一旦甩出三角形底座", "start": 27.549, "end": 30.755, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "幾噸重的車身就會瞬間側翻", "start": 30.755, "end": 33.706, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "加上不可壓縮的液壓系統倍增力量", "start": 33.706, "end": 36.641, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "堆高機靠的不是引擎馬力", "start": 36.641, "end": 38.842, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}, {"text": "而是一場精密的物理力矩拔河", "start": 38.842, "end": 42.0, "y": -0.8, "bg": null, "bga": 1.0}]}, {"type": "audio", "segs": [{"path": "I:\\Mark\\my-kb\\skills\\script2film\\projects\\forklift\\cut_lecture-tech\\voice_lines\\01_旁白.wav", "name": "01_旁白.wav", "start": 0.0, "dur": 7.115, "src": 0.0, "vol": 1.4142}, {"path": "I:\\Mark\\my-kb\\skills\\script2film\\projects\\forklift\\cut_lecture-tech\\voice_lines\\02_旁白.wav", "name": "02_旁白.wav", "start": 7.116, "dur": 7.699, "src": 0.0, "vol": 1.4142}, {"path": "I:\\Mark\\my-kb\\skills\\script2film\\projects\\forklift\\cut_lecture-tech\\voice_lines\\03_旁白.wav", "name": "03_旁白.wav", "start": 14.816, "dur": 8.899, "src": 0.0, "vol": 1.4142}, {"path": "I:\\Mark\\my-kb\\skills\\script2film\\projects\\forklift\\cut_lecture-tech\\voice_lines\\04_旁白.wav", "name": "04_旁白.wav", "start": 23.716, "dur": 9.739, "src": 0.0, "vol": 1.4142}, {"path": "I:\\Mark\\my-kb\\skills\\script2film\\pr